# Research Before Making an Investment

Online franchise directories can make it easier to discover different business categories and compare available opportunities. [**Franchise Opportunities in India**](https://www.franchisebouquet.com/) provides information about franchise and business opportunities across different sectors in India, which can be useful during the initial research stage.

However, the entrepreneur must not depend only on the listings in the directory or the information provided for promotion purposes. It is essential that direct contact be made with the franchiser to get a complete understanding of the cost factors and examine the franchise contract.
